  "notes": "NOON ROOM ROOM \u2014 the lunch-service jukebox 45. An accordion B-side from a Lake Charles wedding band, 1991, and whoever set the brass mic by the dance floor heard everything in the room. A two-step in G: bass on the one and the three, the chuck between them, and a tune that goes around twice because that is how long a 45 gives you."
 },
